    81	=== Damage Types (pages 179-180) ===
    82	
    83	Damage Types
    84	Attacks and other harmful effects deal different
    85	types of damage. Damage types have no rules of
    86	their own, but other rules, such as Resistance, rely
    87	on the types. The Damage Types table offers exam-
    88	ples to help a GM assign a type to a new effect.
    89	Damage Types
    90	Type Examples
    91	Acid Corrosive liquids, digestive enzymes
    92	Bludgeoning Blunt objects, constriction, falling
    93	Cold Freezing water, icy blasts
    94	Fire Flames, unbearable heat
    95	Force Pure magical energy
    96	Lightning Electricity
    97	Type Examples
    98	Necrotic Life-draining energy
    99	Piercing Fangs, puncturing objects
