   106	=== Size (page 188) ===
   107	
   108	Size
   109	A creature or an object belongs to a size category:
   110	Tiny, Small, Medium, Large, Huge, or Gargantuan.
   111	A creature’s size determines how much space the
   112	creature occupies in combat. An object’s size affects
   113	its Hit Points. See also “Breaking Objects” and “Play-
   114	ing the Game” (“Combat”).

